	 * IE IBSS         06
	 * IE IBSS len     02
	 * IE IBSS atim    00 00
	 * reserved        00 00 00 00
	 * capability      02 00
	 * rates           82 84 8b 96 0c 12 18 24 30 48 60 6c 00
	 * fail timeout    ff 00
	 * probe delay     00 00
